r=858AFA\" alt=\"Mastodon\" width=\"99\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252faether-mod.net\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/bluesky-@aether--mod--net-green?logo=cloud&amp;logoSource=feather&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=0085ff\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.threads.net%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/threads-devaether-green?logo=instagram-threads&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=000000\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.facebook.com%252fAetherMod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/facebook-AetherMod-blue?logo=facebook&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=1877F2&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/devaether-instagram?color=D50060&amp;label=instagram&amp;logo=instagram&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/@devaether-tiktok?color=000000&amp;label=tiktok&amp;logo=tiktok&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&amp;label=youtube&amp;logo=youtube&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theaetherteam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitch/status/theaetherteam?logo=twitch&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fTheAether%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&amp;label=reddit&amp;logo=reddit&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faether.wiki.gg%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=wikigg&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=FF1980\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>💡 關於這個附加元件 💡<br></strong></span></h2><p>發光附加元件為天域模組中的<strong>各種物品、方塊和裝備</strong>添加了<strong>發光紋理</strong>。這意味著這些紋理在世界上時，無論光照等級如何，都會顯得明亮。</p><p>這些變更適用於由<strong>琥珀金、鳳凰裝備、地牢符文石甚至排斥護盾</strong>製成的物品。所有物品和方塊的發光紋理都透過模組的資料包檔案處理，而裝備的發光效果可在模組的配置選項中切換。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/emissivity0.png\" width=\"1167\" height=\"402\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 來自天域團隊的更多作品 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>如果您對這個附加元件有任何疑問，或只是對天域團隊開發的其他專案感興趣，歡迎加入天域專案的 Discord！我們友善的工作人員和熱情的社群會讓您有賓至如歸的感覺！</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"282\" height=\"102\"></a></p><p>您也可以透過在 Patreon 上贊助來支持天域團隊！每一筆贊助都直接投入到開發工作中，使我們能夠繼續做我們最熱愛的事。<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
